request.description:
Retrieve paginated orders. Optional `status` filter.

**Success (200):** Paginated list with `data`, `links`, `meta`.

``` bash
{
    "custom_code": 2000,
    "status": true,
    "message": "Data retrieved successfully.",
    "body": {
        "orders": {
            "data": [
                {
                    "id": 1,
                    "customer_name": "John Smith",
                    "customer_email": "john@example.com",
                    "status": "pending",
                    "total": "100.00",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "id": 1,
                            "product_name": "Widget",
                            "quantity": 2,
                            "price": "25.50",
                            "subtotal": "51.00"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": 2,
                            "product_name": "Gadget",
                            "quantity": 1,
                            "price": "49.00",
                            "subtotal": "49.00"
                        }
                    ],
                    "created_at": "2026-06-25T14:16:43+00:00",
                    "updated_at": "2026-06-25T14:16:43+00:00"
                }
            ],
            "pagination": {
                "total": 1,
                "count": 1,
                "per_page": 15,
                "current_page": 1,
                "total_pages": 1
            }
        }
    }
}

 ```

Create an order. Total is calculated automatically.

**Success (201):** Order with status `pending` and calculated total.

``` bash
{
    "custom_code": 2000,
    "status": true,
    "message": "Data created successfully.",
    "body": {
        "order": {
            "id": 2,
            "customer_name": "John Smith",
            "customer_email": "john@example.com",
            "status": "pending",
            "total": "100.00",
            "items": [
                {
                    "id": 3,
                    "product_name": "Widget",
                    "quantity": 2,
                    "price": "25.50",
                    "subtotal": "51.00"
                },
                {
                    "id": 4,
                    "product_name": "Gadget",
                    "quantity": 1,
                    "price": "49.00",
                    "subtotal": "49.00"
                }
            ],
            "created_at": "2026-06-25T14:34:46+00:00",
            "updated_at": "2026-06-25T14:34:46+00:00"
